Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:26.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（澳洲 悉尼）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:35.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（拜塞制药厂）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄米特 每个英雄的诞生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dmitri, every search for a hero…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有一个必备的条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}must begin with something that every hero requires…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有坏蛋出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了寻求我们的英雄…伯洛尔芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, in the search for our hero, Bellerophon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.29,0:00:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制造了一头恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we created a monster, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇美拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chimera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄米特 我求你立刻来悉尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you, Dmitri, come to Sydney…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪我去亚特兰大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and accompany me to Atlanta immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 出发后二十小时内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However we travel, I must arrive at my destination…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.89,0:01:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须抵达目的地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}within 20 hours of departure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 两个半小时后就抵达亚特兰大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks, we're two-and-a-half hours from Atlanta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.37,0:01:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,窗外是壮观的落基山脉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out your window now. We have a great view of the Rocky Mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:02:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不断看表 彷佛生死攸关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep staring at that watch as if your life depended on it, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是有点紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose I'm a bit anxious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.87,0:02:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就见到老朋友了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll soon be with old friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是老朋友 狄米特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with an old friend now, Dmitri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.88,0:02:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉是这种情况下见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry it couldn't be under happier circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很抱歉 我也很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are sorry, and I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.77,0:02:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯基很欣赏你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know Gradski thought the world of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.13,0:02:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在死前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he…know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,知不知道你们研制成功？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the end that you two had succeeded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他知道 只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he knew. Just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不及救他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in time to save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.98,0:02:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,感染上奇美拉病毒超过二十小时…什么都救不了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you've been infected with Chimera for 20 hours, nothing can save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.42,0:02:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,连伯洛尔芬抗毒素都没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even Bellerophon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒和抗毒素放在一起 安全吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can carry them together…safely?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:03:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可到了亚特兰大 你还得给我们找个安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll get us to safe place with them in Atlanta, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是机长 机舱的气压…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your captain again. We've experienced a slight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.12,0:03:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然减低{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but abrupt drop in cabin pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了安全起见 我放下氧气罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a precaution, I've released the oxygen masks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,请各位戴上坐稳 放松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please put them on and sit back, relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,无须恐慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你担不担心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you concerned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时不担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.64,0:03:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你戴上氧气罩 我去看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just put on your oxygen mask. I'll see what's going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹佛中心 这是泛太平洋2207号747客机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denver Center, this is Trans-Pac 2207, 747 heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没法维持机舱气压{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're unable to maintain cabin pressurization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备下降到一万六千英尺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've initiated a descent to one six thousand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,机长…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄米特 我们似乎有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems we have a problem, Dmitri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.55,0:04:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要总叫我狄米特 不应该这样叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep calling me Dmitri. You really shouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是狄米特？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not Dmitri?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,华莱士 拿着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wallis, hold on to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧利 记得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ulrich, remember to pull the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得把毒气筒丢掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember to pull the NO2 tank and dump it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All done, chief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.19,0:05:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有山脉 升高…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrain. Terrain. Pull up. Pull up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达跳伞点！倒数三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, dive, dive! Checkpoint Charlie in three, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,二 一 跳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}two, one, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.97,0:05:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有山脉 升高…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrain. Terrain. Pull up. Pull up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有山脉 升高…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrain. Terrain. Pull up. Pull up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.07,0:05:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有山脉 升高…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrain. Terrain. Pull up. Pull up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,早晨好 亨特先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Mr. Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你接受这项任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission, should you choose to accept it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.21,0:09:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须负责取回失窃物奇美拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}involves the recovery of a stolen item designated "Chimera".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以挑选任何两名队员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may select any two team members, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过第三名必须是娜雅·霍尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it is essential that the third team member be Nyah Nordoff-Hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是一名身手不凡的女窃贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a civilian and a highly capable professional thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要48小时内招揽到霍小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have 48 hours to recruit Miss Nordoff-Hall…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.35,0:09:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后到塞维利亚见我 接受任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and meet me in Seville to receive your assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.06,0:09:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往 假如你们被捕或殉职{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As always, should you or any member of your IMF team be caught or killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府将完全否认涉及此事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the secretary will disavow all knowledge of your actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特先生 下次去度假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Mr. Hunt, the next time you go on holiday, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.05,0:09:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让我们知道你去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}please be good enough to let us know where you're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.05,0:09:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,本讯息五秒后自动毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This message will self-destruct in five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:09:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你知道我去哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I let you know where I'm going…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.41,0:10:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会有假放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I won't be on holiday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.77,0:10:35.36,Title,0,0,0,0,,《碟中谍2》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:46.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西班牙 塞维利亚）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.51,0:13:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.55,0:13:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为只有你会开锁吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you're the only one who can pick a lock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.83,0:13:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你不只是脸蛋漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. You're not just a pretty face after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不介意我在上面吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I'm on top?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 两种姿势我都喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Either way works for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找不到的 - 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll never find it there. - Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我想找什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的宝格丽项链于星期二拍卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His ex's Bulgari necklace that goes up for auction on Tuesday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.58,0:14:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要告诉我在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And are you gonna tell me where it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最左面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.27,0:15:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我分心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very disconcerting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.11,0:15:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你要我在下面 我很听话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you put me here. I just do as I'm told.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who are you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.17,0:15:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得付出什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what's it gonna cost me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你最好别那样 - 不要什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wouldn't do that. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.19,0:15:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Tranquilo. Tranquilo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,齐先生 原来是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Keys, it is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的保安主任齐先生 快道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Mr. Keys, our security engineer. Apologize!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用道歉…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No need to apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.47,0:16:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同事霍小姐把项链藏好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Miss Hall, my associate has your necklace in a very safe place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是警铃应该早一点响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But obviously we do feel the alarm should have gone off a little sooner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吗？霍小姐 - 对极{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Isn't that right, Miss Hall? - Hmm? Oh, absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.66,0:16:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,响得太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much, much too long, I'd say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 我建议…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under the circumstances, I think we'd recommend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.99,0:16:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要调整感应器的承重度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}resetting the sensors to respond to a lighter load.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.13,0:16:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍小姐 四十公斤如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel about 40 kilos, Miss Hall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.87,0:16:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 霍小姐 - 恩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss Hall. - Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有忘记什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you forgotten something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:17:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你打算顺手牵羊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to do, señorita? Rob me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.43,0:17:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是有想过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thought had crossed my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十万镑的项链 得而复失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm missing something here, aside from my half-million-pound necklace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就算搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even after I screwed up the job, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是能把它带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've walked out of there with the bloody thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.92,0:17:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能走就很好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you walked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么袖手旁观 不逮捕我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you watch me go through it all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看你有多高明 我希望跟你合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to see how good you were. I was hoping we might work together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.70,0:17:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很棒 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds terrific. Muchacho.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,言归正传 身手已见识过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now be serious. Whatever you're talking about, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,该打消念头吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you couldn't possibly want me after tonight's performance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你身手并不太差 - 替我打圆场？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't do that badly. - You apologizing for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.18,0:17:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有绅士风度…谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite the gentleman. Gracias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.14,0:17:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见得 警铃是我启动的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really. I triggered the alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.70,0:17:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌做家务 更讨厌那些…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't do laundry, cook, or put up with cheeky bastards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,故意整我的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who set me up on their territory so they can poach on mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 开慢一点好不好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Would you mind slowing down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道号码？我都不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this number? I don't even have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边停车听我说 听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull over and listen to me, will you? Just listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.05,0:18:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听你说什么？- 我要你帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen to what? - I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你或者也需要我帮忙 - 你帮我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I think you could use mine. - Your help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.05,0:19:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我什么？- 我可以让苏格兰警场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - I'm talking about Scotland Yard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际刑警 荷兰警方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interpol, every Dutch authority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都对你既往不咎 - 靠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can make them all go away. - Oh, bloody hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.81,0:19:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你是间谍 你想我合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a spy! Well, if you want me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到再说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've gotta catch me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想玩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You having fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.55,0:19:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.15,0:20:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idiota.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.26,0:20:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看路…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the road. Watch the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.66,0:21:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森·亨特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.37,0:21:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森·亨特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Ethan Hunt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.97,0:21:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找我做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is it you want to talk to me about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.43,0:21:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想做的不言而喻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot more than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,未免太快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awfully short notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我慢慢来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Care to wait a decent interval?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.95,0:21:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想要慢慢来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to be decent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.38,0:22:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么讨厌间谍？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what have you got against spies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用你这种方式招聘间谍？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they've got your recruiting technique?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.91,0:22:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有照规矩来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't exactly by the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.05,0:22:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事也有规矩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got a book for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.17,0:22:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都有规矩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they've got a book for everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.35,0:22:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 所失窃的东西…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this thing these blokes pinched…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道是不是失窃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know that they pinched it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.76,0:22:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不确定他们是贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know that they're blokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.27,0:23:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你要我干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为你要我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought I'm supposed to be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.44,0:23:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,以贼捉贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}some kind of thief to catch a thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也以为…大约如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I…sort of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.47,0:23:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, you're beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.01,0:24:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,义式咖啡？卡布其诺？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Espresso? Cappuccino?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.99,0:24:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不用客气 - 请坐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, thanks. - Sit down. Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.31,0:24:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,节庆真烦人 他们用焚烧圣像来纪念圣人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Festival's a pain in the ass. Honoring their saints by setting them on fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.74,0:24:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算哪门子的尊敬？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lets you know what they think of saints, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.75,0:24:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才我差点也被烧到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn near set me on fire on my way over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.18,0:24:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉中断了你的假期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I barged in on your vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.82,0:25:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我没说我在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I didn't let you know where I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.63,0:25:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别道歉 说了就不算度假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be. It wouldn't be a vacation if you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.76,0:25:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很抱歉 我也很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sorry, and I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.32,0:25:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you phrase it like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.98,0:25:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么说？ - 你抱歉 我也抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like what? - "You're sorry; I'm sorry."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.52,0:25:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在耍我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta be kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.61,0:25:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄米特 我又要你帮忙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dmitri, once again I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.62,0:25:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像以前一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as in the old days, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.54,0:25:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我们的性命和灵魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you saved our lives, saved our very sanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.69,0:25:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄米特…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dmitri…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.06,0:25:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有…小小一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have this little problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.77,0:25:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个英雄的诞生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every search for a hero…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.56,0:25:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有一个必备的条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}must begin with something that every hero requires…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.05,0:25:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个坏蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.88,0:25:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了寻求我们的英雄伯洛尔芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, in the search for our hero, Bellerophon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:26:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制造了一头恶魔…奇美拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we created a monster, Chimera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.98,0:26:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄米特 我求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg you, Dmitri, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.45,0:26:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即来悉尼 陪我去亚特兰大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}come to Sydney and accompany me to Atlanta immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.14,0:26:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何…出发后二十小时内…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However we travel, I must arrive at my destination…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.02,0:26:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须抵达目的地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}within 20 hours of departure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.34,0:26:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…我只有你一个信得过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear I can entrust this to no one but you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.37,0:26:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄米特 我们说过 我很抱歉 你也很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dmitri, as we say, I'm sorry and you're sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.45,0:26:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的这些你是怎么想的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what the hell he's talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.96,0:26:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点头绪 - 怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An idea? Yeah. - Like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.46,0:26:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该尽快去接他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it's a good idea to pick him up in a hurry…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.94,0:26:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且用专机去接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a bad idea to fly him on a commercial carrier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.13,0:26:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在悉尼？- 诺考维奇博士已经死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he still in Sydney? - Dr. Vladimir Nekhovich is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.55,0:26:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的同事葛斯基较早前也死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is his colleague Gradski, but that happened earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.22,0:26:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺考维奇的飞机 在落基山脉撞毁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had Nekhovich on a flight from Sydney that crashed in the Rockies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.62,0:26:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死了…- 你在听着吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dead? - Are you listening to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.78,0:26:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如他一定要有我陪才走…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he didn't want to go anywhere without me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.08,0:27:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么肯搭飞机？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how did you get him on that flight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.50,0:27:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到你 只好找别人代替你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I couldn't find you, I had to replace you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.32,0:27:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,西恩·安柏斯是最佳人选{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean Ambrose was the obvious choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.64,0:27:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他扮过你两三次了吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he doubled you, what, two or three times?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.45,0:27:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两次 - 你认为他怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Twice. - What did you think of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.38,0:27:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不太合得来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had our reservations about each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.00,0:27:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在问未免太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it a little late to be asking me that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.71,0:27:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,未必 根据航空公司的记录…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not necessarily. Airline records…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.80,0:27:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,2207班机的机长叫麦哈洛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}list a Captain Harold Macintosh as the pilot of flight 2207.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.17,0:27:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,媒体和政府都认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as the media and all government agencies are concerned, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.99,0:27:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦哈洛机长死于空难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Macintosh died on the flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.23,0:27:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他没搭那班机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, in fact, he missed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.50,0:27:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他搭下一班机的货舱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did, however, make the next flight…in cargo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.78,0:27:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个大汉 却挤在小行李箱里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuffed into a rather small suitcase, considering his size.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.35,0:28:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,即是说 有人在飞机上动了手脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, someone on that flight planned an operation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.22,0:28:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,暗中把飞机坠毁 造成意外的假象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}designed to bring the plane down and make it look like an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.54,0:28:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且没留下蛛丝马迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone skillful enough to bring the whole thing off without a hitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.11,0:28:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人必定是安柏斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's one thing we know that Ambrose doesn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.30,0:28:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么认定是他？你不惊讶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do think it was Ambrose? You're not surprised?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.17,0:28:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他每次出动 不杀人不甘心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean feels he hasn't done the job unless he leaves a lot of hats on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.98,0:28:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是为什么？诺考维奇 所携带的奇美拉是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is why? What was this, uh, Chimera, Nekhovich was carrying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.53,0:28:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有安柏斯才知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Ambrose knows that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.09,0:28:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 你要找奇美拉…并且带它回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, you must recover this…whatever…Chimera, and bring it to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.43,0:28:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知他如何用奇美拉来赚钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to do that, I have to figure out how he plans to make money with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.11,0:28:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要出动霍小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is where Miss Hall comes in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.76,0:28:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.77,0:28:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍小姐和他本来是情人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Hall and Ambrose had a relationship which he took very seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.71,0:28:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走掉 安一直望她回心转意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She walked away, and he's been wanting her back ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.89,0:28:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍小姐出马 十拿九稳找到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe she's our surest and quickest way of locating him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.94,0:28:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.77,0:29:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她继续跟他交往{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, make sure she continues to see him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,套出他的话再向你报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}gets him to confide in her, and report to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.09,0:29:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当初叫我招揽她 好像是为了她的偷窃才能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it sound as if I was recruiting her for her skills as a thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.76,0:29:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我误导了你 或者你会错意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I misled you, or you made the wrong assumption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.40,0:29:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是请她继续一段恋情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, we're asking her to resume a prior relationship, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.26,0:29:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是勉强她做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not do anything she hasn't already done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.46,0:29:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是出于自愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voluntarily, I might add.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.00,0:29:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 她没有受过这种训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she's got no training for this kind of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.48,0:29:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只要跟男人上床 她是女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, to go to bed with a man and lie to him? She's a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.03,0:29:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她与生俱来的天赋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got all the training she needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.99,0:29:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我说服不了她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can get her to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.83,0:29:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你认为困难？- 非常困难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean it'll be difficult. - Very.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.66,0:30:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是困难的任务 这是不可能的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is not Mission Difficult, Mr. Hunt, it's Mission Impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.65,0:30:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,困难对于你就像公园散步一样简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Difficult should be a walk in the park for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.56,0:30:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你个建议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm open to suggestion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.16,0:30:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你有办法对付安柏斯 尽管去试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can think of a quicker way, you're welcome to try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.32,0:30:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得对她良心不安的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might take a look at these…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.14,0:30:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妨看看这些照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you have any further qualms about getting her to do the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.21,0:31:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会这样狠心 滥杀无辜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people are capable of something like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.40,0:31:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,西恩·安柏斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean Ambrose, for one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.52,0:31:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当初没打算要你这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't what I had in mind, Nyah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.04,0:31:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你现在希望我自愿做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is what you'd like me to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.05,0:31:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？你以为我有正义感肯接受任务？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Oh, let my conscience be my guide, is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:31:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.58,0:32:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有正义感 我只是个贼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a conscience. I'm a bloody thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.47,0:32:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要逼我去做吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna try and force me to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.83,0:32:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般来说 我不会逼任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Generally, I don't favor coercing someone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.02,0:32:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他们可能决定我的生死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not when there's a chance my life could end up in their hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.69,0:32:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是唯一原因？- 还有更好原因？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that the only reason? - Can you think of a better one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.03,0:32:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 但我总希望你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? No. But I was just hoping that you might, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.63,0:32:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了公事公办 还有更私人的理由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}thinking that somewhere, this got personal as well as physical!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.55,0:32:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我不要你去 你会高兴吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it make you feel any better if I didn't want you to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.55,0:32:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然会 - 那就高兴吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, much. - Then feel better!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.31,0:33:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我突然回到他身边…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Sean will never be anything but suspicious…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.08,0:33:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会引起他的怀疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I pitch up saying, "Hey, honey, I'm home."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.93,0:33:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样才不引起他的怀疑？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What wouldn't make him suspicious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.40,0:33:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我惹上大麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I needed him in some urgent way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.79,0:33:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦到束手无策{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destitute. In serious trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.13,0:33:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己根本没有办法解决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind I couldn't possibly sort out myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.83,0:33:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,大麻烦…我总可以安排得来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serious trouble, Nyah, is something that I can always arrange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.96,0:33:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这微型发射器 绝不会露出马脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This transponder chip is completely untraceable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.05,0:33:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把你的位置传送上卫星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It transmits your location to a satellite…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.95,0:33:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这部电脑才能够解读{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which can be read by only this computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.98,0:33:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你去到哪里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can then track you to within three feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.77,0:33:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,都可以追踪到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.61,0:33:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经通知全世界的警方…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since your arrest, I've been sending news bulletins…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.82,0:33:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逮捕了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to every law enforcement agency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.55,0:34:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解西恩…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Sean Ambrose, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.14,0:34:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠机事件后他必定…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I guarantee that after that airline crash, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.16,0:34:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定在密切留意每一个执法机构{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's monitoring everyone of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.98,0:34:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你被捕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows you're there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.18,0:34:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有办法把你弄出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has the means to get you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.31,0:34:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.53,0:34:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.40,0:34:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放弃你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna lose you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.80,0:35:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森·亨特？ 你好 我是威廉 叫我比利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan Hunt? G'day, mate. I'm William Baird. Billy's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.02,0:35:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论想要什么 搬运或监视 找我准没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you need me to get, move or watch, just let me know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.61,0:35:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先到处看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have a look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.77,0:35:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狗屎 - 一点也没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit. - Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.47,0:35:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.75,0:35:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是高级的古奇皮鞋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just bought these $800 Gucci shoes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.98,0:35:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还叫我跟那小子同机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you got me in a helicopter with this man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.79,0:36:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,连线 找到她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer's up. We got her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.81,0:36:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入座标 展示画面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's put in the coordinates and get a visual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.83,0:36:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没有画面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visuals aren't coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.79,0:37:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人造卫星没我这么快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The satellite doesn't work as fast as I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.37,0:37:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 久仰大名了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I heard about you, Luther. Just wanna say it's an honor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.19,0:37:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸能跟你们两位合作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a pleasure to be working with you blokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.56,0:37:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能快一点吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Isn't there any way we can speed this up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.49,0:37:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没法 只有这部电脑才有这功能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With what? This is the only computer that'll do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.04,0:38:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.71,0:38:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才算热情的欢迎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there's a bloke who knows how to give a proper welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.79,0:38:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要误会 你也满热情的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong, mate. You were very friendly also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.01,0:38:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是他？- 是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it him? - It's him, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.50,0:38:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们找到他了 - 状况还不明朗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So we've got him! - We don't know what we've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.47,0:38:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道他抢走什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we don't know what he's got, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.68,0:38:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是他打算在悉尼干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he's got it or what he's doing in Sydney with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.08,0:39:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没什么行李 - 我走得勿忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not much luggage. - I left in a bit of a hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.41,0:39:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感谢你 西恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm incredibly grateful, Sean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.45,0:39:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎找到我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How in the world did you find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.87,0:39:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用的是老方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I usually find you, Nyah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.29,0:39:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭魔术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.93,0:39:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身上没有追踪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, mmm! No flies on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.27,0:39:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有偷听器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bugs, either. No transmissions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.48,0:39:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没可疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.13,0:39:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人总令人没有戒心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All cats are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.73,0:39:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的房间？- 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your room? - Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.76,0:39:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的房间？- 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And my room? - Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.38,0:40:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她进去了 在屋内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did it. She's in the compound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.08,0:40:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是滚出一个雪球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? We just rolled up a snowball and tossed it into hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.85,0:40:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在得看能得到什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we'll see what chance it has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.94,0:40:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.00,0:40:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.81,0:40:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道有没有记错你的尺码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dying to see if I remembered your size.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.25,0:41:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想看我穿上它的样子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not interested in seeing how it looks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.89,0:41:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有兴趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.67,0:41:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.78,0:41:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个英雄的诞生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every search for a hero…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.09,0:41:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有一个必备的条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}must begin with something that every hero requires…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.49,0:41:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个坏蛋出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a villain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.41,0:41:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了寻求我们的英雄伯洛尔芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, in the search for our hero, Bellerophon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.25,0:42:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制造了一头恶魔…奇美拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we created a monster, Chimera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.09,0:42:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺考维奇是位分子生物学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nekhovich was a molecular biologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.53,0:42:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么大谈古代希腊神话？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is he going on about an old Greek myth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.39,0:42:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的专长是结合不同遗传基因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nekhovich specialized in recombining DNA molecules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.26,0:42:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个神话中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the myth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.16,0:42:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯洛尔芬是屠杀了奇美拉的王子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bellerophon was a prince who killed the Chimera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.62,0:42:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇美拉是个狮头蛇身…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster with the head of a lion and the tail of a serpent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.81,0:42:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它让瘟疫降临人间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who plagued the ancient world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.21,0:42:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计诺考维奇研制了一种叫 奇美拉的致命病毒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Nekhovich created a monster virus named Chimera…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.51,0:42:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也研制了叫伯洛尔芬 的抗毒素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the antivirus to kill it, named Bellerophon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.79,0:42:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这么简单？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That simple, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.86,0:42:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.20,0:43:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人肯出三千七百万镑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}£37 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.75,0:43:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,收购诺考维奇的发明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's a promising bid for Nekhovich's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.02,0:43:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 就快成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look so worried, Hugh. We're halfway there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.01,0:43:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这数码磁碟…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll need this at the track…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.63,0:43:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,带去马场 跟买家谈妥条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we're gonna get the other half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.30,0:43:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就…大功告成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then…sorted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.30,0:43:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,未必{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.18,0:43:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来这里 究竟有什么目的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think she's really here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.07,0:43:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的看法？抑或我的看法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From her point of view or mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.40,0:43:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,半年前她离开你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she wasn't exactly gagging for it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.82,0:44:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见得依依不舍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she left you six months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.84,0:44:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 现在你能相信她吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, do you trust her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.91,0:44:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机的确很敏感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One considers her timing, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.20,0:44:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在坠机后一个礼拜内被捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting nicked within a week of the plane going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.54,0:44:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,未免巧合 也有点可疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suggestive, even borderline suspicious, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.67,0:44:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不能证明什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but hardly conclusive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.55,0:44:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正你知道就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you've thought about it, at any rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.11,0:44:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,休斯 告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, Hugh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.48,0:44:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在监视她的一举一动吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't exactly hang on Nyah's every word and gesture, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.63,0:44:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的指甲太长了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a fairly ratty nail that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.24,0:45:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,西恩 求求你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.25,0:45:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算她是间谍 中情局派她来当卧底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppose she is some sort of Trojan horse sent in by IMF to spy on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.07,0:45:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,送上门的肥肉为何不咬一口？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I deny myself the pleasure of a ride or two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.37,0:45:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认为我道行比她高？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or don't you think I can learn more from her than she can from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.94,0:45:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do! I do! I do! I do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.76,0:45:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,休斯 你要明白…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Hugh, you must realize that some of us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.94,0:45:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人未必放得下一个色字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have the burden of sex to deal with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.53,0:45:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我或者看不破她的来意…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I may or may not know why she thinks she's here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.06,0:45:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我愿意冒这个险 因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm willing to take the risk, because, Hugh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.85,0:45:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确依依不舍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gagging for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.33,0:46:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.86,0:46:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你赢了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darling! You won!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.44,0:46:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大概是 - 为什么选中那匹老马？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I suppose I did. - What made you pick that nag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.48,0:46:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一场都未赢过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never won a bloody thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.63,0:46:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它叫「午夜神偷」 - 原来如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Thief in the Night." - Say no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.49,0:46:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去买酒 你还爱喝百利尼斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm off to grab a drink. Do you still favor the Bellinis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.97,0:46:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.71,0:46:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「天生虚荣」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Naturally Vain."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.21,0:46:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.58,0:46:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,「天生虚荣」 第四场 赌它赢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally Vain…in the fourth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.98,0:46:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得考虑 胜算甚高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check her out. She's due.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.92,0:46:57.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（塞进耳内）
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.77,0:47:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以当我在身边那样说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can speak as if I'm right by your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.73,0:47:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.08,0:47:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑道旁边 两点钟方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mounting enclosure just off the track, 2:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.86,0:47:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.03,0:47:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like old times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.61,0:47:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like old times?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.70,0:47:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.89,0:47:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在安柏斯家看到谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me who you've run into at Ambrose's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.93,0:47:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我的估计 那儿有五、六个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Near as I can tell, there's about a half dozen other blokes about the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.54,0:47:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者更多 其中一个休斯·史坦普 西恩的老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe more. Hugh Stamp, old friend of Sean's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.31,0:47:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只认得他 讨厌的傢伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the only one I recognize. And a bit of a creep and then some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.29,0:48:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就在你左后方 正在望着你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know him. He's over your left shoulder, looking at you right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.45,0:48:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,安柏斯有一张报纸 上面有一堆钞票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambrose has photos of newspapers with money piled on them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.33,0:48:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,三千七百万英镑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty seven million on the London Times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.06,0:48:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.43,0:48:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人出价买奇美拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bids from possible Chimera buyers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.58,0:48:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,安柏斯跟一个人在酒吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambrose is meeting some bloke in the bar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.72,0:48:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大个子 淡黄色头发 他们在谈事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big bloke. Ginger hair. They're into something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.09,0:48:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是谁？- 我正在查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this guy? - Checking now, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.70,0:48:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·麦寇 拜塞制药厂总裁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John McCloy, CEO Biocyte Pharmaceuticals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.05,0:48:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,1989年并购拜塞药厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1989, acquired Biocyte in a hostile takeover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.41,0:49:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是诺考维奇的老板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was Nekhovich's boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.13,0:49:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 诺考维奇生前替他研制药物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. He worked for him as a research scientist at Biocyte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.37,0:49:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,安柏斯用数码相机给他看东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambrose is showing something to McCloy on a digital camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.43,0:49:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那是什么 麦寇并不满意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever McCloy's looking at, he's not happy about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.36,0:49:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,安柏斯抽出…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambrose just pulled…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.85,0:49:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,记忆卡塞进信封{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the camera's memory card and put it into an envelope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.48,0:49:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,放到上衣左面内袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it in his inner left jacket pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.25,0:49:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复：上衣左内袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm left jacket pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.61,0:49:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.56,0:49:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜雅 安柏斯回来找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyah. Nyah, Ambrose is on his way back to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.50,0:49:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有个信封…- 在他西装左边内袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's an envelope inside…- His left jacket pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.03,0:49:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.83,0:49:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎样交给你？- 投注站第十二号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where do I meet you? - Betting table 12, off the paddock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.60,0:49:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应付得来吗？- 我会混过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you sure you're up to this? - I'll muddle through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.42,0:50:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你回来了！- 你看好哪一匹？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you are! - See anything you like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.07,0:50:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 「天生虚荣」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, "Naturally Vain."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.68,0:50:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,投注快要截止 我却没有钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're about to close the betting, and I haven't a bean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.41,0:50:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 娜雅！- 介意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nyah! - Would you mind terribly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.35,0:50:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不介意 但你要还{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all. But, um, you are gonna pay for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.29,0:50:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 连本带利 - 当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And with interest. - I have no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.36,0:50:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.97,0:50:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我落一千块注{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down a thousand for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.18,0:50:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 买赢的？- 那还用说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To win? - What else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.86,0:50:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比利 别让他跟着娜雅 - 包在我身上好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Billy, make sure Nyah's not followed. - No worries, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.10,0:50:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 准备数码相机传送{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, digital camera ready to transmit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.99,0:50:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到十二号赌桌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betting table 12.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.29,0:51:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请进 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There you go. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.28,0:51:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是对不起 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry about that, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.24,0:51:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.83,0:51:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好给我小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you're about, in future, watch your step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.03,0:51:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会知道会碰上什么人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never know who you might run into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.10,0:51:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗手间呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's the loo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.48,0:51:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.47,0:51:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.49,0:52:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要转身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.24,0:52:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.00,0:52:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你转过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.16,0:52:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,转又怎样？打我屁股？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do? Spank me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.81,0:52:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 随时可以接收{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm booted up. Go, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.56,0:52:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,接收到没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you getting this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.11,0:52:59.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（奇美拉感染血液）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.96,0:53:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟盖·葛斯基{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergei Gradski{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.51,0:53:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,感染20小时后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 hours after exposure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.13,0:53:14.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（感染27小时后）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.64,0:53:30.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（感染31小时后）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.65,0:53:39.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（细胞迅速摧毁）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.16,0:53:45.79,Note,0,0,0,0,,（葛斯基博士 于34小时后死亡）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.21,0:53:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.12,0:53:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,史坦普从厕所出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stamp 's out of the loo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.89,0:54:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向你们那儿走去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming out of the tunnel, heading your way, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.61,0:54:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要你离开安柏斯家 - 你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want you out of Ambrose's place. - What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.38,0:54:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？你看到什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened? What did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.74,0:54:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 他向你背后走过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, he's coming up behind you, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.24,0:54:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已完成任务 我要你离开澳洲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done your job. I want you out of Australia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.74,0:54:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 距离三十步 - 我该怎么离开？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thirty steps. - How do you suggest I go about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.46,0:54:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,20 19\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty, nineteen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.51,0:54:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你舍不得离开他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's touched your heart. You need to think it over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.80,0:54:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,15 14 12 11…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen, fourteen, twelve, eleven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.47,0:54:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽快离开 把耳机给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you out of there now. Give me the earpiece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.27,0:54:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 九 八 - 你不走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nine, Ethan. Eight. - If you don't get out of there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.14,0:54:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就去救你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming in and getting you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.54,0:54:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, get out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.71,0:54:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,下了注没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You placed your bet, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.64,0:54:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.29,0:54:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horses are ready to race.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.84,0:54:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.95,0:55:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的马在外跑道迎头而上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on! Your nag's making a run for it on the outside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.03,0:55:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.91,0:55:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又赢了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked another winner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.64,0:55:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为你要去吃晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were going to dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.05,0:55:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,收藏好诺考维奇的记忆卡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hugh, take care of the Nekhovich memory card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.18,0:55:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.08,0:55:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的西装口袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the envelope in my jacket pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.62,0:55:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,右边的口袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My right jacket pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.46,0:55:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜塞制药厂采用先进太阳能设计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We at our state-of-the-art solar-powered Biocyte building, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.86,0:55:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的宗旨是预防胜于治疗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}recognize that eternal vigilance is the price of health, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.93,0:55:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们资助皇家爱德华王子医院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether it's funding the teaching center at the Royal Prince Edward Hospital, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.24,0:55:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,主张废除使用气溶胶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}removing aerosol products from the market…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.50,0:55:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为第三世界注射防疫针{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or braving the influenza quarantine at Bruny Island late last month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.29,0:55:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拜塞制药厂 为你的一生…奉献出一生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Biocyte, your life is our life's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.16,0:56:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是大好的机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got an opportunity here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.30,0:56:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不会错过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to miss it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.96,0:56:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 载我回家去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George, take me home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.16,0:56:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.22,0:57:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.07,0:57:12.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（药厂老板 死于罕见感冒病毒）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.41,0:57:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么搞的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.95,0:57:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,西恩…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.84,0:57:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,西恩…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.81,0:58:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.67,0:58:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.88,0:58:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.77,0:58:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I am now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.30,0:59:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 一个老朋友来看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is this? - A visit from an old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.27,0:59:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是撞机死了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crashed on the plane. You're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.41,0:59:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,死 免不了 只是时间问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead, certainly. But dead is a little extreme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.34,0:59:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我的同事…葛斯基的脉搏 血压…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other hand, when my colleague Gradski had your pulse…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.12,0:59:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样的时候 他已经活不过一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your blood pressure, he had less than a day to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.46,0:59:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感染了奇美拉病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are infected with Chimera, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.16,0:59:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用叫人来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No use, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.74,1:00:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,护士不想淌这浑水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The medical staff wants no part of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.84,1:00:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生也不想白白送死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors don't fancy the idea of dying any more than anybody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.99,1:00:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会被感染？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I possibly be infected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.02,1:00:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯基死前27小时…也这样问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what Gradski said 27 hours before he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.69,1:00:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有解药 王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the antidote, you miserable bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.18,1:00:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把抗毒素全都偷走了 - 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You stole Bellerophon! All of it! - My…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.03,1:00:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个我需要它 你这个俄罗斯疯子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need it! I need it now, you whacked-out Russian Gypsy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.80,1:00:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛斯基呢？ 你为什么故意让他感染病毒？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about Gradski, who you deliberately infected with Chimera?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.75,1:00:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道二十小时内要替他解毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was I to know they needed to be treated with Bellerophon within 20 hours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.13,1:00:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以问我 - 你还是不懂 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By asking me. - You still don't get it, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.17,1:00:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要知道病毒真正的威力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to know just how bad the disease was in the real world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.15,1:00:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是实验结果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not just the lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.90,1:00:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你混合了几种病毒基因…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were genetically splicing together strains of influenza…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.35,1:00:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,研制出一种抗毒素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to create a cure for all influenzas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.57,1:00:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你也研制出致命病毒奇美拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were also creating a disease so terrible in Chimera, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.89,1:00:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗毒素就变成无价之宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cure would be priceless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.33,1:00:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要奇美拉来促销伯洛尔芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed Chimera in order to peddle Bellerophon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.57,1:00:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不难明白吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that difficult to understand, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.93,1:01:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有病毒 你有抗毒素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've got the virus. You've got the cure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.00,1:01:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我两样都需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.98,1:01:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前盘尼西林能解百毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time was a shot of penicillin would knock off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.02,1:01:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不管用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}every bloody bug in the zoo. Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.13,1:01:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在得了感冒都用不着吃药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I couldn't make money killing the microscopic little shits out there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.35,1:01:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮我散播可以赚钱的病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, you'd help me put one out there that I could make money on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.07,1:01:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是前因后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there it is. I've confessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.79,1:01:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我约翰·麦寇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, John C. McCloy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.84,1:01:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了赚钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}am in business to make money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.21,1:01:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你跟安柏斯是怎么谈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, forget any deal you may have made with that thug Ambrose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.67,1:01:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你把我治好 继续工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me treated, and let's go back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.41,1:01:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.58,1:01:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已经太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's a little late for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.97,1:01:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见到葛斯基…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do give my regards to Gradski…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.57,1:01:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我问候他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.31,1:02:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.16,1:02:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经听到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.78,1:02:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该知道的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all I need to hear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.76,1:02:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是我们不要惊动西恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's imperative that we do nothing to alarm Ambrose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.42,1:02:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.26,1:02:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我立刻下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me to get out of there as soon as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.89,1:02:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你是来救我的 - 嘘 嘘…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you were here to collect me! - Shh, shh, shh, shh, shh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.07,1:02:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 现在没有时间解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. There's no time to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.92,1:02:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是…绝对最重要的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is critical, absolutely critical, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.30,1:02:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,照安柏斯的话去做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you do whatever Ambrose asks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.11,1:02:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,明不明白？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.95,1:02:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.12,1:03:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事…很快会结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will all be over…very soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.69,1:03:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.98,1:03:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 回去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on. Off you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.59,1:03:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 我们知道这么多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, we know this much. Nekhovich gets on a plane…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.69,1:03:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺考维奇搭飞机 去亚特兰大的疾病控制中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go to the Center for Disease Control in Atlanta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.41,1:03:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带了自己研制的奇美拉病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's carrying a virus he created, Chimera, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.42,1:04:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及抗毒素 伯洛尔芬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the cure for that virus, Bellerophon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.87,1:04:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,安柏斯没有病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambrose doesn't have the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.94,1:04:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他需要麦寇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why Ambrose needs McCloy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.81,1:04:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们如果潜入药厂消灭病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we go into Biocyte, kill Chimera, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.82,1:04:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,安柏斯的抗毒素没有用处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambrose has a cure without a disease, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.91,1:04:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're home free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.44,1:04:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出你所料 伊森今晚绑走麦寇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right. Hunt stung McCloy tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.29,1:04:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道了 他一定会到拜塞制药厂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he knows. He'll be going into Biocyte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.45,1:04:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那么 我们掌握到他的行踪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Then we'll know where he'll be, don't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.15,1:04:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 休斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Hugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.43,1:04:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.10,1:04:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到家了 到家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi! You're home, mate. Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.06,1:05:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.96,1:05:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我平时的司机乔治呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My regular driver? Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.01,1:05:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得了感冒 回家休息了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone home sick. Touch of the flu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.34,1:05:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是拜塞制药厂？- 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is the building up and running yet? - Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.64,1:05:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧？- 不好意思 这里就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not exactly it. - Sorry, but this is a Biocyte facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.45,1:05:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们的仓库 马上就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their storage structure. I'll have it up in a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.02,1:05:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看看 - 从内部开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, take a look at this. - Start from the inside out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.02,1:05:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇美拉病毒都存在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All storage and production of Chimera is done here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.26,1:05:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,42楼的实验室内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this lab on the 42nd floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.19,1:05:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森的目标是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt's target will be the Chimera, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.96,1:05:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在42楼的病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stored and manufactured at Biocyte on the 42nd floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.21,1:05:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的一贯行动习惯是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you look at Hunt's operational history, and I have, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.81,1:05:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免正面冲突{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he invariably favors misdirection over confrontation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.18,1:05:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝对不会从守卫最森严的一楼着手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll never break into Biocyte from the bottom where security is heaviest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.85,1:05:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车场没入口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No garage entrances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.77,1:06:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,大厅有五名警卫巡逻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lobby's protected by five guards on rotating patrol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.76,1:06:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不从地面进去 从屋顶怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not goin' in from the ground. Show me the atrium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.92,1:06:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶？独一无二{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The atrium? One of a kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.29,1:06:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,从大楼中央一路到底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Runs down through the center of the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.58,1:06:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,24小时天然照明 采用折射镜和太阳能电池{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Provides 24-hournaturallight via mirrors and daylight storage cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.87,1:06:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为病毒提供最适度的培植环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Optimal growing conditions for the virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.24,1:06:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,底部的玻璃地板下面是实验室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ends in a glass floor which doubles as part of the lab ceiling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.25,1:06:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落后屋顶就关闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-uh. The atrium roof closes at sundown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.38,1:06:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如活叶板在晚上开启超过四十秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if the louvers are up for more than 40seconds at night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.73,1:06:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,会触动警铃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the civil emergency alarms are tripped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.73,1:06:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我都无法解除{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those, even I can't stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.77,1:06:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 我们一共有四十秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, we have a total of 40 seconds…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.32,1:06:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你进去然后收回缆绳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get you in and the cables out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.30,1:06:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森多数会会从屋顶进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Hunt will prefer to enter Biocyte somewhere from the top…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.27,1:06:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为楼顶保安最松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where security is minimal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.41,1:06:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会亲自大玩特技动作…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll undoubtedly engage in some aerobatic insanity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.10,1:06:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不肯动警卫一根头发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before he'll risk harming a hair on a security guard's head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.89,1:07:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 试音 听到吗？- 听到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check check. Got copy? - You're five-by-five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.77,1:07:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 情况怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, how we doin '?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.16,1:07:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不行 我会通知你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not there yet, Ethan. I'll give you the word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.87,1:07:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 准备好没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, ready to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.08,1:07:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,五秒后行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, package away in five…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.97,1:07:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没好 活叶板还未打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not ready. The louvers aren't moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.46,1:07:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 路德 要行动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Luther! We gotta go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.72,1:07:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在输入密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, there's a glitch in the access code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.10,1:07:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 时间无多 开始倒数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, we're out of time. On the count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.43,1:07:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,开吧 乖乖打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, baby, open up, open up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.67,1:08:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五 四… - 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five, four… - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.68,1:08:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}three, two, one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.04,1:08:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我下去了！- 等一等！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going now! - Ethan, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.88,1:08:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,25 24 23…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty five, twenty four, twenty three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.35,1:08:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,22 21 20…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty two, twenty one, twenty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.90,1:08:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,19秒后要把缆绳收回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, you've got 19seconds to clear the cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.06,1:09:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,收回缆绳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, retracting cable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.64,1:09:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,九 八 七 六 五…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine, eight, seven, six, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.28,1:09:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四 三 二…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}five, four, three, two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.95,1:09:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,缆绳收回！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cable's clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.30,1:09:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启追踪器 追踪货物位置 收回了缆绳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transponder activated. Reading package and cable clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.91,1:09:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会在千均一发之间…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll breach the lab at the only possible time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.32,1:09:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入实验室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether you break in from the ground or the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.22,1:09:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十三时零一分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 2300 hours, one minute…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.16,1:10:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气过滤器发动机开动 会掩盖伊森在里面的声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the air filtration generators will cover the sound of Hunt's break-in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.92,1:10:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 趁警卫换班…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the rotating guards make the building vulnerable…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.18,1:10:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从楼下进入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to our break-in from below.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.37,1:10:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 发动机就快启动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, the generator's about to go active.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.98,1:10:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,开动后 我们会中断联络八分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a friendly reminder. We'll be out of contact for eight minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.59,1:10:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定伊森会把病毒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm betting Hunt will destroy Chimera…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.48,1:10:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather than attempt to preserve any part of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.82,1:10:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒放在两个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll have to do it in two places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.77,1:10:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一部分…保温室里的病毒培养瓶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, the incubation room where the growth vials are kept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.14,1:11:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一部分存放在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And finally, in the inoculation chamber…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.28,1:11:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,疫苗接种室 三支装有病毒的注射枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}holding the last remaining Chimera virus in three injection guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.95,1:11:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要阻止他消灭注射枪内的病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be allowed to destroy the virus in those guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.59,1:11:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？你们第一次准时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this? You're on time, for once?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.01,1:11:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见得 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly, sport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.04,1:11:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·麦寇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John C. McCloy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.02,1:12:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 我们有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, I think we've got a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.17,1:12:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜雅来这儿了 你听到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyah's on the wing up early. Billy, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.84,1:12:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到 路德 娜雅在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got you, Luther. Sorry, exactly where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.08,1:12:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在大楼里 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the building. - Say again, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.72,1:12:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说她在大楼里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like you're saying she's in the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.29,1:12:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 她在药厂里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am. She is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.08,1:12:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是只有她一个人 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, then she's not likely to be alone, is she, mate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.89,1:12:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,她进了电梯往伊森那儿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in the elevator, headed towards Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.46,1:12:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 总共有多少人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is: How many of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.32,1:12:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等发电机停了才能警告伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get through to Ethan, not till the generators go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.07,1:12:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候停？ - 五分三十秒后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, well, when's that? - Not for another five-and-a-half minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.91,1:13:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒酸碱值 温度…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chimera in vitro pH and temperature level…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.66,1:13:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,超出最适当范围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}outside optimal range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.52,1:13:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,病毒酸碱值 温度…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chimera in vitro pH and temperature level…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.01,1:13:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,超出最适当范围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}outside optimal range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.32,1:13:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇美拉病毒受到威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chimera working seed stock pH at critical level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.97,1:13:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告：病毒受到威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert. Chimera stock life threatened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.46,1:13:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告：病毒被消灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert. Chimera stock life terminated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.17,1:13:41.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（病毒已经消灭）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.74,1:13:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森…快点吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Ethan. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.38,1:14:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,物体并无污染{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject is contaminant-free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.72,1:14:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,污染程度：零{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero contaminant factor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.87,1:14:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.14,1:14:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 有什么办法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, what the hell can we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.30,1:14:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么办法？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.38,1:14:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯有希望黄点到达红点前 他已消灭病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope he kills all the bugs before the yellow dot gets to the red one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.83,1:15:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However we travel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.40,1:15:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发后二十小时内 必须抵达目的地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must arrive at my destination within 20 hours of departure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.70,1:15:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道二十小时内…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was I to know that he needed to be treated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.77,1:15:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,要替他解毒？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Bellerophon within 20hours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.97,1:16:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.26,1:16:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还等多久才可以连络上？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer before you can reach him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.53,1:16:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有29秒 发动机关闭才可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got 29 seconds before the generators turn off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.64,1:16:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后伊森能够连上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Ethan will be back on-line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.27,1:17:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德！…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther! Luther!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.50,1:17:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.64,1:17:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire, damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.18,1:18:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Hunt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.62,1:18:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,近况如何？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how've you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.59,1:18:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,患了点感冒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fighting a bit of a cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.59,1:18:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,假扮你最难的地方是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that was the hardest part of having to portray you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.67,1:18:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,每十五分钟 就像白痴一样傻笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}grinning like an idiot every 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.10,1:18:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,假扮你最难的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've thought the hardest part was curbing that pressing need of yours…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.38,1:18:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,动不动就杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get your gun off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.64,1:18:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你急着毁掉那架747客机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in such a hurry to knock off that 747…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.65,1:18:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,连奇美拉是什么还没知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never figured out where Chimera really was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.25,1:18:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道奇美拉是什么 - 哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew where it was. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.86,1:18:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺考维奇把病毒注射入自己体内…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you knew the only way Nekhovich could smuggle the live virus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.03,1:18:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,才可以利用自己的血液 把病毒带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is by injecting himself and using his own bloodstream as a petri dish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.80,1:18:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道…你杀掉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew that…while you were knocking him off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.26,1:19:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也杀掉你所要的病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}destroying the very thing you came for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.91,1:19:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开枪！停手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Put a sock in it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.65,1:19:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,打中注射枪 病毒就会散播出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit that bloody gun, and you'll spray the virus all over the place!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.21,1:19:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 病毒在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.95,1:19:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一支{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.54,1:19:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,价高者得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the top bid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.35,1:19:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意出更高价？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You gonna make me a better offer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.38,1:19:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,高过三千七百万镑？不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than £37 million? Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.60,1:19:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在向你告密{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody has been slipping you our mail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.42,1:19:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来吧 坏女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out here, you bad girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.92,1:20:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,西恩 这件事与她无关 放她走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, she doesn't belong here. Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.20,1:20:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 不是因为你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't be here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.89,1:20:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不会在这里出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it wasn't for you, Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.17,1:20:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,由现在起…她是生是死 看你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this moment, you are responsible for what happens to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.17,1:20:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你爱护她…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're looking out for her well-being, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.73,1:20:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好叫她捡起注射枪…交来给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest you advise her to pick up the injection gun and bring it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.24,1:20:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你了 伊森{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ball's in your court, Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.90,1:20:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜雅在药厂内 听到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyah's in the building. Do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.32,1:20:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.02,1:21:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他得到之后不会杀你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know he won't shoot you the minute he's got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.77,1:21:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你得让她自己决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. One can't hold Nyah responsible for her actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.44,1:21:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也了解女人 女人是最善变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know women, mate. Like monkeys they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.50,1:21:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住下一根树枝才会放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't let go of one branch till they get a grip on the next!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.44,1:21:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜雅 捡起来 我掩护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it, Nyah. I'll cover you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.60,1:21:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.19,1:22:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情跟你原来想的不一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things haven't exactly worked out the way you thought they would, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.09,1:22:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.20,1:22:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,臭婊子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.25,1:22:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能杀我 西恩 我这婊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna shoot me, Sean. Not this bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.52,1:22:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为贱人值三千七百万镑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause she's worth £37 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.37,1:23:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你打算怎样？- 我没有打算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you think you were doing? - I wasn't thinking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.96,1:23:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想让你受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to stop you from getting hurt, that's all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.57,1:23:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说自己没有正义感{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You who don't have a conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.52,1:23:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大概说了谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.64,1:24:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救不了我们两个 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't get us both out of here, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.42,1:24:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感染了病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm infected with Chimera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.46,1:24:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有选择余地 开枪吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you don't have a choice. Just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.74,1:24:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.27,1:24:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,19小时58分钟之内…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got 19 hours and 58 minutes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.39,1:24:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会替你注射抗毒素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get Bellerophon into your system before then!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.55,1:25:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,活下去 我不会失去你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay alive! I'm not going to lose you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.01,1:26:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不想跪地求饶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel like pleading for your life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.71,1:26:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就死了好了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, how about dying…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.08,1:26:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了 我发大财{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can make me a lot of money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.70,1:26:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个钟头后 你会一举成名…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In just a few hours time, you can be assured…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.34,1:26:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为新病毒之母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of going down in history as the Typhoid Mary of Oz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.33,1:26:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}G'day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.50,1:26:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,和卫星连上线才能找到娜雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a chance of locating Nyah until can access the satellite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.03,1:26:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,想接收卫星资料需要修妥电脑 这得花点时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's not a chance of doing that until I can get this computer fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.95,1:26:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有多少时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time does she have left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.01,1:27:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不多 不管怎样 她自有决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not long. But whatever happens, Nyah will take care of Nyah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.09,1:27:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？ - 若没有抗毒素…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - Unless we dose her with Bellerophon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.45,1:27:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜雅会自杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nyah will kill herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.49,1:27:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以事不宜迟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So first things first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.09,1:28:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,安柏斯一伙人到了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, Ambrose and his team have arrived…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.05,1:28:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见娜雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the bridge, and Nyah's not with him, mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.57,1:28:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.15,1:28:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你行不行？看来警卫挺多的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, mate? Looks like pretty heavy security from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.16,1:28:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it look like from there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.17,1:28:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Risky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.15,1:29:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,西蒙？西蒙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon? Simon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.75,1:29:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.87,1:30:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,从左前方入了屋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breached the structure at the 10:00 grating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.79,1:30:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,DNA吻合 血液充满奇美拉病毒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a DNA match. The blood's loaded with Chimera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.52,1:30:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的确有伯洛尔芬 抗毒素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they certainly have Bellerophon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.49,1:30:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你既然有病毒及抗毒素…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then you've got both the virus and the antivirus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.50,1:30:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在可以给你三千万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means I've got 30 million for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.38,1:30:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要的不仅是钞票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly. We don't want just your cash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.25,1:30:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还要什么？- 股份 麦寇先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want? - Stock, Mr. McCloy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.79,1:30:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确而言 现值三千万的股份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stock options, to be a little more precise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.49,1:31:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在市中心释放她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut her loose…right in the center of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.93,1:31:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,人口越多越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more crowded the better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.16,1:31:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 刚截到安柏斯的通讯 他们释放了娜雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, just picked up an Ambrose call. Nyah's been dropped off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.47,1:31:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在哪里？- 悉尼某处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? - Somewhere in Sydney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.15,1:31:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,悉尼某处？能够准确些吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere in Sydney? Care to harden the target?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.44,1:31:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能够…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't until…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.58,1:31:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑还未接通卫星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get the GPS up on our computer. It's down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.98,1:31:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clock is ticking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.86,1:31:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,生产抗毒素要多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How quickly can you manufacture more of the antivirus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.85,1:31:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一有样板 立即可以生产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time at all, once I've got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.12,1:31:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出几星期 拜塞股价很快就会涨停板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Biocyte stock is just a few weeks away from going through the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.24,1:31:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 奇美拉病毒爆发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - An outbreak of Chimera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.68,1:31:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪里爆发？- 由悉尼市开始 向全球蔓延{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Downtown Sydney, for a start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.68,1:32:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你制造解药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You create the supply, Mr. McCloy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.68,1:32:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制造需求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've just created the demand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.44,1:32:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,悉尼三百万人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three million people in Sydney…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.35,1:32:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,澳洲一千七百万人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and 17 million people in Australia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.62,1:32:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,几天内 个个都要抗毒素{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are going to need Bellerophon within the next few days, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.49,1:32:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早全世界人人都要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to mention the rest of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.72,1:32:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的条件是这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is how it's going to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.99,1:32:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总共有多少股份？ - 9340万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wallis, the shares outstanding are? - 93.4 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.03,1:32:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,即是说我们要买下48万张选择股{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means, Mr. McCloy, we need to get our hands on 480, 000 options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.03,1:32:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要借用你的三千万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll borrow your 30 million to buy those options.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.29,1:32:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的股票每股最多31元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your stock has never sold above $31 a share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.87,1:32:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当它涨到二百元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your stock goes north of 200, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.02,1:32:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会的 我的股票就会值几十亿元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which it will, those options will be worth billions, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.25,1:32:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候我就有拜塞制51%股权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will own 51% of Biocyte.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.65,1:32:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,太荒谬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is outrageous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.30,1:32:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你控制我的公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not let you take control of my company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.06,1:32:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.01,1:33:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做亿万富豪抑或想破产？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be a billionaire. It's better than being broke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.17,1:33:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多恐怖分子和制药厂都等着要货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have terrorists and other pharmaceutical companies standing in line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.44,1:33:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,接不接纳我的条件随便你 麦寇先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ball's in your court, Mr. McCloy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.92,1:34:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把那个兔崽子宰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run that bastard down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.03,1:35:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 麦寇先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running short on time, Mr. McCloy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.26,1:35:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的交易还没完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have got to conclude our business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.23,1:35:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 开始转帐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Start the transfer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.12,1:35:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱到手 通知我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow it…and let me know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.70,1:35:35.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（转帐中）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.66,1:36:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢举起手来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise your hands very slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.73,1:36:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要我举手？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you want me to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.66,1:36:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢把手举起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise your hands very slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.39,1:37:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 你听到吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, Ethan, do you copy? Do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.56,1:37:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续转帐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.81,1:37:27.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（转帐中）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.24,1:37:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,西恩 我逮到那只兔崽子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, this rat's reached the end of the maze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.07,1:37:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,死了没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.48,1:37:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,半死不活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, more or less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.60,1:37:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.13,1:37:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,起飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.83,1:37:48.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（转帐完成）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.05,1:37:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,西恩 钱到手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, transfer completed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.02,1:38:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 史坦普{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Stamp. Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.28,1:38:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop mumbling!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.56,1:38:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕他说不了了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid he's got no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.11,1:38:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我把他下巴打歪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I broke his jaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.12,1:38:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,史坦普 有你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stamp, I'm impressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.62,1:38:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们时间不多 亨特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. We don't have a lot of time, Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.03,1:38:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么话 快说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What ever you got to say, say it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.52,1:38:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,露一露招牌笑容 怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about giving us a big smile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.57,1:39:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不笑？- 你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.97,1:39:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down on your knees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.15,1:39:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你见识见识…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this is what's known…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.59,1:39:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才叫大开杀戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as getting your gun off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.61,1:40:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.62,1:40:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.79,1:41:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲开 找她去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just back off and pinpoint your positions!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.04,1:42:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 解决桥上的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, clear the bridge for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.83,1:42:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特往桥那儿冲过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt's heading for the bridge, coming in at 12:00 high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.26,1:42:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我火大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm mad now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.13,1:43:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 臭小子射穿我的范思哲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right, mate? - That punk put a hole in my Versace!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.99,1:44:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 电脑接通 找到娜雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, the computer's up. I've got Nyah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.07,1:44:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她离开市中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's moved out of the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.57,1:44:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她正走向北边的悬崖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's on the north head bluff approaching the cliffs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.96,1:44:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还未接收到画面 - 收到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I can't get a visual. - Copy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.44,1:44:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's only got a little time left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.80,1:44:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快去接她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Track ahead and pick her up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.72,1:45:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能够瞄准！- 伊森 我们没法掩护你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't get a good shot. - Ethan, we won't be able to cover you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.46,1:45:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳机坏了 用卫星定位系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My earpiece is failing! You've got me on GPS!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.20,1:45:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带来找我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.41,1:45:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,比利 北边的悬崖 快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy, north head bluff. Haul ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.80,1:45:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冲过去 继续开枪 - 我看不见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out there and keep firing! - I can't see anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.24,1:46:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,开慢点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down, mate! Slow down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.16,1:48:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两公里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Range is 2K.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.52,1:51:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 用刀杀我 这种死法不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Use it, Hunt. It's not a bad way to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.71,1:51:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比那臭婊子的死法好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lot better than the way that bitch is gonna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.22,1:52:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there she is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.12,1:54:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该杀了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've killed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.76,1:56:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,娜雅的血液内似乎…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Hall's blood, it appears, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.93,1:56:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点奇美拉病毒都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has absolutely no elements of the Chimera virus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.26,1:56:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,连抗毒素都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not even antibodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.41,1:56:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I gathered as much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.55,1:56:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特 我给你的任务是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were under specific instructions, Mr. Hunt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.17,1:56:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把病毒的活样本带回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring back a living sample of the Chimera virus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.81,1:56:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道重新拿回病毒后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be very interested to know how, after you managed this recovery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.15,1:56:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会被销毁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it subsequently got destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.24,1:56:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,被火烧掉 最好的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By fire. It's the best way, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.87,1:56:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 亨特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Well, Mr. Hunt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.46,1:57:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次任务霍小姐作用不小{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as for Miss Hall, in light of her efforts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.01,1:57:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的犯罪记录当然会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}her criminal record will certainly be expunged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.27,1:57:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一笔勾销 我猜你应该同意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wiped out. I'm assuming you approve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.89,1:57:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.93,1:57:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便问句 她现在在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Where is she now, by the way? Any idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.69,1:57:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不大清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Not exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.51,1:57:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么打算？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are your plans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.60,1:57:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 或者度假去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Uh, some sort of vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.65,1:57:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你我去哪里度假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you know where I'm going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.29,1:57:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不一定要告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.39,1:57:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了就不算度假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wouldn't be a vacation if you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.38,1:58:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们去度假吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get lost.{\r}
